<title>USA: Guilford Pharmaceuticals sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Guilford Pharmaceuticals sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Guilford Pharmaceuticals Inc said Tuesday that its board of directors has declared a three-for-two stock split payable by way of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable November 12, 1996 to holders of record October 28.</p>
</text>
